    "detailed_description": "Dive into the heart-pounding action of Mageanoid. As a powerful mage, your task is to fend off relentless waves of undead skeletons with your magical powers. Each second counts as you unleash your spells and dodge the deadly strikes of their swords. How long can you survive in this epic twin-stick shooter?<br><br>Source Code available on GitHub<br><br><br>Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Pixel art graphics that bring the undead world to life<br></li><li>Fast-paced twin-stick shooting action<br></li><li>Endless waves of enemies to test your skills</li></ul><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> Mageanoid is a simple game created in just one week to learn the Bevy game engine and the Rust programming language. Don't expect a lot of content; this is my first project with both tools.",
